{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-21T22:01:50.700Z","data":{"text":"Task 7 complete.\n\n**Summary**\n\n- **`src/core/show.ts`**: Added a derived `recertifications` projection on `SpecDetails`, built only from typed `recertification` events in numeric task streams (never `change.jsonl`, never markers). Each row exposes task number, timestamp, outcome, sorted differing paths with per-path attribution, verify command, exit code, and timeout state, with malformed fields rendered as unavailable. Rows sort by valid timestamp, then numeric task, then stream/event order. `formatSpecDetails` now renders a `Recertifications` section (after `Planning Sessions`, before the raw timeline) only when rows exist, labeling `passed` as **recertified** and `requeued` as **requeued for agent work**, and rendering `attributed to task <n>` / `ambiguous` / `unknown` per sorted path.\n- **`tests/show.test.ts`**: Added six tests covering active/archived histories, all attribution states, repeated/same-timestamp ordering, malformed data, section placement/labels, and proof that done-marker metadata is not used as history. Also replaced the planning-sentinel verify with a local `node verify.cjs` verifier (fixing two pre-existing failures from task 4's lint fallout).\n\nVerify: `node --import tsx --test tests/show.test.ts` → **15 pass / 0 fail**; `pnpm tsc --noEmit` and `pnpm lint` green. Result written to `.run/results/7.md`."}}
